  storyText: 主药用的是{color=#d0380a}{SayStcVal=939}{/color}，辅药为{color=#d0380a}{SayStcVal=940}{/color}，至于药引则是{color=#d0380a}{SayStcVal=941}{/color}，需得按{color=#d0380a}{SayStcVal=942}{/color}的比例添加，方可炼制成功。
